 a lot of people have been  talking online several insiders have  been stating that secret wars should be  coming a lot sooner than everybody  thinks a lot of people think that  everything needs to build up again it's  going to take another 10 years for the  next avengers in-game level event to  happen again but according to some it's  probably going to be coming in 2026 and  according to some rumors online it was  even supposed to come in 2024 but  unfortunately the pandemic pushed it  back but this is great news if we only  have to wait four more years till  another avengers end game that's really  not bad and definitely is a lot closer  than i expected especially since we  don't even really have an avengers team  right now but we have plenty of time for  heroes to come together to form an  avengers team so i'm not worried about  it at all but i am really really excited  so let me know what you think about all  of this in the comments down below don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  so you don't miss out on any of the  future videos for live updates you can  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof

